{"side-list":"\n    <article class=\"side-card\">\n      <div class=\"side-art\"><img src=\"assets/side/robotfac3-logo.jpg\" alt=\"RobotFac3 wordmark around a robot head, off-white and red on black.\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <div class=\"side-body\">\n        <div class=\"side-meta\"><span class=\"now-tag t-hackathon\">Hackathon</span><span class=\"side-year\">2026</span><span class=\"now-status\">In progress</span></div>\n        <h3>RobotFac3</h3>\n        <p class=\"side-line\">A browser concept for the web, Web3 and AI agents, with one set of security rules for all three.</p>\n        <ul class=\"side-points\"><li>The hackathon build is the Solana part. Type a Solana name, connect Phantom only when you need it, and see each SOL payment in plain words before you sign.</li><li>A built-in agent follows the same guardrails, and a person approves every signature. For now the agent is scripted. No AI model is connected yet.</li><li>I lead product vision, UI direction and community on a team of three, with a security engineer and an ops and project lead.</li><li>It is a local web prototype with 27 passing tests, built for an online crypto hackathon. Entries close Oct 12, 2026.</li></ul>\n        <div class=\"side-foot\"><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">Solana</span><span class=\"chip\">AI agents</span><span class=\"chip\">Product + UI</span></span></div>\n        <p class=\"side-credit\">Logo: AI-generated draft.</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"side-card\">\n      <div class=\"side-art is-icon\"><img src=\"assets/side/catblast-icon.webp\" alt=\"App icon: a grumpy orange and purple cat in an open cardboard box.\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <div class=\"side-body\">\n        <div class=\"side-meta\"><span class=\"now-tag t-game\">Mobile game</span><span class=\"side-year\">2025–26</span><span class=\"now-status exploring\">Android build</span></div>\n        <h3>Cat in a Box</h3>\n        <p class=\"side-line\">A relaxing block puzzle made of cats I drew.</p>\n        <ul class=\"side-points\"><li>Drag cat pieces onto an 8x8 grid to clear rows and columns. When a line cuts through a big cat, the leftover cells break into kittens.</li><li>I designed the game, drew all the art and built it in Godot with AI help.</li><li>Endless mode is playable. A Schrödinger's cat version with boxed cats and boosts is in design.</li><li>Planned for the Solana dApp Store on Seeker phones. Not published yet. For now it is a signed Android build for testing.</li></ul>\n        <div class=\"side-foot\"><span class=\"chips\"><span class=\"chip\">Game design</span><span class=\"chip\">Illustration</span><span class=\"chip\">Godot</span><span class=\"chip\">Android</span></span><a href=\"https://docs.solanamobile.com/solana-mobile-stack/dapp-store\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">About the Solana dApp Store ↗</a></div>\n        \n      </div>\n    </article>","now-chips":"<button class=\"chip on\" data-tag=\"all\">all</button><button class=\"chip\" data-tag=\"hackathon\">hackathon</button><button class=\"chip\" data-tag=\"website\">website</button><button class=\"chip\" data-tag=\"product\">product</button><button class=\"chip\" data-tag=\"game\">game</button><button class=\"chip\" data-tag=\"build\">build</button><button class=\"chip\" data-tag=\"experiment\">experiment</button>","now-list":"\n      <div class=\"now-item\">\n        <span class=\"now-date\">Sep 2026</span>\n        <div><h3>RobotFac3</h3><span class=\"now-tag t-hackathon\">hackathon</span><p>A Solana browser concept where you and an agent share one set of guardrails. Entries close Oct 12.</p></div>\n        <span class=\"now-status \">In progress</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"now-item\">\n        <span class=\"now-date\">Sep 2026</span>\n        <div><h3>Pet wellness launch</h3><span class=\"now-tag t-website\">website</span><p>A custom Shopify theme built around one flagship product, a daily food topper for dogs.</p></div>\n        <span class=\"now-status \">In progress</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"now-item\">\n        <span class=\"now-date\">Sep 2026</span>\n        <div><h3>Strategist website</h3><span class=\"now-tag t-website\">website</span><p>A brand-led 2026 website for a growth and exit strategist.</p></div>\n        <span class=\"now-status \">In progress</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"now-item\">\n        <span class=\"now-date\">Sep 2026</span>\n        <div><h3>The Known site</h3><span class=\"now-tag t-website\">website</span><p>Bitmap hero, this file viewer and a plain-language services page.</p></div>\n        <span class=\"now-status \">In progress</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"now-item\">\n        <span class=\"now-date\">Sep 2026</span>\n        <div><h3>Quote On</h3><span class=\"now-tag t-product\">product</span><p>AI chat flow and job costing for an Android quoting app for tradies. <a href=\"#/instaquote/0\" style=\"color:var(--blue)\">See the file ↗</a></p></div>\n        <span class=\"now-status \">In design</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"now-item\">\n        <span class=\"now-date\">Sep 2026</span>\n        <div><h3>Cat in a Box: Schrödinger mode</h3><span class=\"now-tag t-game\">game</span><p>Planned cat states and boosts. Boxed cats would show two shapes until you touch them.</p></div>\n        <span class=\"now-status \">In design</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"now-item\">\n        <span class=\"now-date\">Sep 2026</span>\n        <div><h3>Websites + CRM with Veruthia</h3><span class=\"now-tag t-build\">build</span><p>Brand and design from Known, development and security from Veruthia, for contractors.</p></div>\n        <span class=\"now-status \">In progress</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"now-item\">\n        <span class=\"now-date\">2026–27</span>\n        <div><h3>NFC cards, then a booth</h3><span class=\"now-tag t-experiment\">experiment</span><p>Tap-to-open business cards first. The long game is a walk-in brand booth.</p></div>\n        <span class=\"now-status exploring\">Exploring</span>\n      </div>","work-list":"\n    <article class=\"proj\" id=\"p-sapphire\">\n      <button class=\"proj-row\" data-open=\"sapphire\">\n        <span class=\"proj-no\">001</span>\n        <span><span class=\"proj-title\">Sapphire Studios</span><span class=\"proj-open\">Open file ↗</span><br><span class=\"proj-hook\">The back office for an official TikTok Marketing Partner.</span><br><span class=\"proj-line\">One portal for a creator agency: casting, campaigns, scripts and payments in one place.</span></span>\n        <span class=\"proj-side\">Product design · Design system<br>2024–25</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"panel desktop\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-open=\"sapphire\" aria-label=\"Open the Sapphire Studios file\"><img src=\"assets/sapphire/creators-mosaic.webp\" alt=\"Sapphire Studios agency portal: a mosaic of creator profiles used for casting.\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"panel-stat\"><b>3 days → 4 hrs</b><small>to cast a campaign <i>sample</i></small></span><span class=\"panel-cta\">Open file ↗</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quick\">\n        <div class=\"quick-ba\">\n          <div><small>Before</small><p>Campaigns ran across spreadsheets, email and DMs.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"after\"><small>After</small><p>One portal where the agency casts, briefs and pays creators.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"quick-stats\"><div><b>3 days → 4 hrs</b><small>to cast a campaign</small></div><div><b>+38%</b><small>creator reply rate</small></div><div><b>−52%</b><small>support DMs</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"quick-foot\"><span class=\"badge sample\">Sample figures</span><button class=\"btn\" data-open=\"sapphire\">Open the full file</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"proj\" id=\"p-instaquote\">\n      <button class=\"proj-row\" data-open=\"instaquote\">\n        <span class=\"proj-no\">002</span>\n        <span><span class=\"proj-title\">Quote On</span><span class=\"proj-open\">Open file ↗</span><br><span class=\"proj-hook\">Tradies lose 10 to 15 hours a week to admin. This gives the evenings back.</span><br><span class=\"proj-line\">An Android app where a tradie talks through a job and gets a priced quote draft in minutes.</span></span>\n        <span class=\"proj-side\">Product design · AI UX · Android<br>2026</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"panel phone\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-open=\"instaquote\" aria-label=\"Open the Quote On file\"><img src=\"assets/instaquote/chat-start.png\" alt=\"Quote On Android app: chat start, photo upload, quote draft and job costing screens.\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"assets/instaquote/chat-photo.png\" alt=\"Quote On Android app: chat start, photo upload, quote draft and job costing screens.\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"assets/instaquote/chat-draft.png\" alt=\"Quote On Android app: chat start, photo upload, quote draft and job costing screens.\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"assets/instaquote/job-costing.png\" alt=\"Quote On Android app: chat start, photo upload, quote draft and job costing screens.\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"panel-stat\"><b>45 → 6 min</b><small>to draft a quote <i>sample</i></small></span><span class=\"panel-cta\">Open file ↗</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quick\">\n        <div class=\"quick-ba\">\n          <div><small>Before</small><p>Quotes written at night, from memory, often under-priced.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"after\"><small>After</small><p>Say the job out loud, check the draft, send it.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"quick-stats\"><div><b>45 → 6 min</b><small>to draft a quote</small></div><div><b>5 steps</b><small>from install to first quote</small></div><div><b>0</b><small>prices the AI is allowed to invent</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"quick-foot\"><span class=\"badge sample\">Sample figures</span><button class=\"btn\" data-open=\"instaquote\">Open the full file</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"proj\" id=\"p-profitmind\">\n      <button class=\"proj-row\" data-open=\"profitmind\">\n        <span class=\"proj-no\">003</span>\n        <span><span class=\"proj-title\">Profitmind</span><span class=\"proj-open\">Open file ↗</span><br><span class=\"proj-hook\">The AI found the money. The redesign got people to act on it.</span><br><span class=\"proj-line\">UX research and redesign for an AI platform that tells retailers what to stock and how to price it.</span></span>\n        <span class=\"proj-side\">UX research · AI research · B2B SaaS<br>2025–26</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"panel html\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-open=\"profitmind\" aria-label=\"Open the Profitmind file\"><div class=\"shot-html\"><div class=\"scaled\">\n      <div class=\"pm\">\n    <aside class=\"pm-side\">\n      <div class=\"pm-brand\">Assortment<br>Intelligence</div>\n      <div class=\"pm-nav\">Executive summary</div><div class=\"pm-nav\">Opportunities</div><div class=\"pm-nav\">Reports</div><div class=\"pm-nav on\">Assortment</div><div class=\"pm-nav\">Product matching</div><div class=\"pm-nav\">Price alerts</div><div class=\"pm-nav\">Settings</div>\n      <div class=\"pm-sample\">Sample data</div>\n    </aside>\n        <main class=\"pm-main\">\n    <div class=\"pm-kpis\">\n      <div class=\"pm-kpi\"><small>Opportunities found</small><b>$8.2M</b><span>41 open</span></div>\n      <div class=\"pm-kpi\"><small>Next 5 weeks</small><b>$1.9M</b><span>17 insights</span></div>\n      <div class=\"pm-kpi\"><small>Next 52 weeks</small><b>$6.3M</b><span>24 insights</span></div>\n      <div class=\"pm-kpi\"><small>Market matched</small><b>71%</b><span>6,180 products</span></div>\n    </div><div class=\"pm-tabs\"><span class=\"on\">Overview</span><span class=\"\">Revenue</span><span class=\"\">Profit</span><span class=\"\">Hindsight</span></div>\n          <div class=\"pm-grid\">\n            <section class=\"pm-card pm-focus\">\n              <h3>Key areas to focus on <em>Quarter to date</em></h3>\n              \n                <div class=\"pm-f\">\n                  <div class=\"pm-n\">1</div>\n                  <div class=\"pm-fb\"><b>Grow Lighting into white space</b>\n                    <div class=\"pm-chips\"><i class=\"g\">+$1.4M profit</i><i class=\"b\">+$2.9M revenue</i></div>\n                    <p><strong>Why:</strong> Pendant and floor lamps sell through 2× faster than the rest of the range, and you carry 40% fewer than competitors.</p></div>\n                  <button>Review</button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"pm-f\">\n                  <div class=\"pm-n\">2</div>\n                  <div class=\"pm-fb\"><b>Expand Rugs by 18 products</b>\n                    <div class=\"pm-chips\"><i class=\"g\">+$0.8M profit</i><i class=\"b\">+$1.6M revenue</i></div>\n                    <p><strong>Why:</strong> Mid-price rugs are out of stock 3 weeks in 10. Shoppers leave rather than trade up.</p></div>\n                  <button>Review</button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"pm-f\">\n                  <div class=\"pm-n\">3</div>\n                  <div class=\"pm-fb\"><b>Free up cash in Storage</b>\n                    <div class=\"pm-chips\"><i class=\"g\">+$610K cash</i></div>\n                    <p><strong>Why:</strong> 22% of Storage stock is older than 90 days. Marking down 31 products releases the cash with little margin loss.</p></div>\n                  <button>Review</button>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"pm-card\">\n              <h3>Opportunity value by category</h3>\n              <div class=\"pm-bars\">\n                <div class=\"pm-bar\"><span>Lighting</span><div><i style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"p\" style=\"width:58%\"></i></div></div>\n                <div class=\"pm-bar\"><span>Rugs</span><div><i style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"p\" style=\"width:40%\"></i></div></div>\n                <div class=\"pm-bar\"><span>Bedding</span><div><i style=\"width:38%\"></i><i class=\"p\" style=\"width:22%\"></i></div></div>\n                <div class=\"pm-bar\"><span>Storage</span><div><i style=\"width:26%\"></i><i class=\"p\" style=\"width:30%\"></i></div></div>\n                <div class=\"pm-bar\"><span>Decor</span><div><i style=\"width:18%\"></i><i class=\"p\" style=\"width:9%\"></i></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"pm-legend\"><i></i>Revenue <i class=\"p\"></i>Profit</div>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pm-grid two\">\n            <section class=\"pm-card\"><h3>White space</h3><div class=\"pm-stat\">+60% <small>products in \"occasion\" pieces</small></div>\n              <ul><li>Material: natural fibres up 45%</li><li>Style: print holds a steady 25% lift</li></ul></section>\n            <section class=\"pm-card\"><h3>Productivity</h3><div class=\"pm-stat\">5.2× <small>stock turn, above the market</small></div>\n              <ul><li>$9M of stock is older than 90 days</li><li>12% overstocked, 18% understocked</li></ul></section>\n          </div>\n        </main></div></div></div><span class=\"panel-stat\"><b>14 → 4 min</b><small>to a first decision <i>sample</i></small></span><span class=\"panel-cta\">Open file ↗</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quick\">\n        <div class=\"quick-ba\">\n          <div><small>Before</small><p>The AI found the money. Buyers could not see why, so they did not act.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"after\"><small>After</small><p>Three things to do today, the reason for each, and a human sign-off.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"quick-stats\"><div><b>14 → 4 min</b><small>to a first decision</small></div><div><b>3 → 9</b><small>insights acted on per session</small></div><div><b>2.6 → 4.1</b><small>trust in AI advice (of 5)</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"quick-foot\"><span class=\"badge sample\">Sample figures</span><button class=\"btn\" data-open=\"profitmind\">Open the full file</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"proj\" id=\"p-edu\">\n      <button class=\"proj-row\" data-open=\"edu\">\n        <span class=\"proj-no\">004</span>\n        <span><span class=\"proj-title\">Legacy courseware turnaround</span><span class=\"proj-open\">Open file ↗</span><br><span class=\"proj-hook\">Three legacy platforms, one scorecard that shows leadership where learners get stuck.</span><br><span class=\"proj-line\">Came into a learning platform built around 2010, cut the redundancy and built the scorecard that proved it worked.</span></span>\n        <span class=\"proj-side\">UX research · Legacy software · Metrics</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"panel doc\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-open=\"edu\" aria-label=\"Open the Legacy courseware turnaround file\"><img src=\"assets/edu/scorecard-v1.jpg\" alt=\"Legacy courseware turnaround: usability scorecard and platform detail pages.\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"assets/edu/platform-detail.jpg\" alt=\"Legacy courseware turnaround: usability scorecard and platform detail pages.\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"panel-stat\"><b>26 min → 2 s</b><small>to find a resource, 2022 → 2024</small></span><span class=\"panel-cta\">Open file ↗</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quick\">\n        <div class=\"quick-ba\">\n          <div><small>Before</small><p>Eight clicks to open an eBook. Up to 26 minutes to find a resource.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"after\"><small>After</small><p>Two clicks. Two seconds. A usability score up from 40 to 72.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"quick-stats\"><div><b>26 min → 2 s</b><small>to find a resource, 2022 → 2024</small></div><div><b>8 → 2</b><small>clicks to open an eBook</small></div><div><b>10 → 5 min</b><small>to create an assignment</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"quick-foot\"><span class=\"badge real\">Real figures</span><button class=\"btn\" data-open=\"edu\">Open the full file</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"proj\" id=\"p-selig\">\n      <button class=\"proj-row\" data-open=\"selig\">\n        <span class=\"proj-no\">005</span>\n        <span><span class=\"proj-title\">Selig Sealing</span><span class=\"proj-open\">Open file ↗</span><br><span class=\"proj-hook\">A 130-year-old manufacturer whose website was costing it leads.</span><br><span class=\"proj-line\">A page-by-page audit of a B2B lead-generation site: what is broken, how to fix it and what to do first.</span></span>\n        <span class=\"proj-side\">UX audit · Accessibility · SEO<br>2022</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"panel doc\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-open=\"selig\" aria-label=\"Open the Selig Sealing file\"><img src=\"assets/selig/navigation.png\" alt=\"Selig Sealing website audit: navigation, homepage and products pages with findings.\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"assets/selig/homepage.png\" alt=\"Selig Sealing website audit: navigation, homepage and products pages with findings.\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"assets/selig/products.png\" alt=\"Selig Sealing website audit: navigation, homepage and products pages with findings.\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"panel-stat\"><b>31</b><small>findings, 12 high priority <i>sample</i></small></span><span class=\"panel-cta\">Open file ↗</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quick\">\n        <div class=\"quick-ba\">\n          <div><small>Before</small><p>A lead-gen site that read as an outdated template.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"after\"><small>After</small><p>A ranked fix list the client could hand straight to developers.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"quick-stats\"><div><b>31</b><small>findings, 12 high priority</small></div><div><b>4 max</b><small>main navigation items, down from 9</small></div><div><b>6 → 3</b><small>clicks to a datasheet</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"quick-foot\"><span class=\"badge sample\">Sample figures</span><button class=\"btn\" data-open=\"selig\">Open the full file</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </article>","more-list":"\n    <div class=\"more-row\">\n      <span class=\"proj-no\">006</span>\n      <span><span class=\"more-title\">Neutrogena.com rebrand</span><span class=\"more-line\">Lead designer for the NTG.com rebrand, built to ADA and North American brand standards.</span></span>\n      <span class=\"more-co\">Kenvue</span>\n      <span class=\"more-role\">Creative direction, e-commerce, design system</span>\n      <span class=\"more-year\">2023–24</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"more-row\">\n      <span class=\"proj-no\">007</span>\n      <span><span class=\"more-title\">Ad-platform style guides</span><span class=\"more-line\">Motion, icons and templates for email, social and landing pages, plus brand guides for Conversant and AdParlor.</span></span>\n      <span class=\"more-co\">Bath &amp; Body Works</span>\n      <span class=\"more-role\">Motion, iconography, templates</span>\n      <span class=\"more-year\">2022–23</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"more-row\">\n      <span class=\"proj-no\">008</span>\n      <span><span class=\"more-title\">Salon pro campaigns</span><span class=\"more-line\">Emails, web, social, decks and motion for the professional salon market, tuned with analytics.</span></span>\n      <span class=\"more-co\">SalonCentric (L'Oréal USA)</span>\n      <span class=\"more-role\">Art direction, email, motion</span>\n      <span class=\"more-year\">2020–22</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"more-row\">\n      <span class=\"proj-no\">009</span>\n      <span><span class=\"more-title\">Beauty email + landing pages</span><span class=\"more-line\">Email, landing pages and social for brand redesigns and seasonal campaigns.</span></span>\n      <span class=\"more-co\">Estée Lauder, Clinique, FoodKick</span>\n      <span class=\